@page "/demo/virtualize"
@rendermode InteractiveServer
@implements IDisposable

<PageTitle>Demo 7 · Virtualize</PageTitle>

<DemoHeader Number="7" Title="Virtualize con elementi di altezza variabile">
    10.000 eventi con descrizioni di lunghezza diversa, espandibili e riducibili.
    In .NET 11 <code>Virtualize</code> misura le altezze reali, offre <code>ScrollToItemAsync</code>,
    <code>InitialItemIndex</code> e il nuovo <code>AnchorMode</code>.
</DemoHeader>

<div class="row g-4">
    <div class="col-xl-8">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header fw-semibold d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 align-items-center">
                Timeline eventi
                <span class="badge text-bg-light border" data-testid="event-count">@events.Count.ToString("N0") eventi</span>
                <div class="ms-auto d-flex gap-2 align-items-center">
                    <label class="small" for="anchor">AnchorMode</label>
                    <select id="anchor" class="form-select form-select-sm w-auto" @bind="anchorMode">
                        @foreach (var mode in Enum.GetValues<VirtualizeAnchorMode>())
                        {
                            <option value="@mode">@mode</option>
                        }
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body pb-2">
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-2">
                    <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" @onclick="ScrollToStart">⤒ Inizio</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" @onclick="ScrollToEnd">⤓ Fine</button>
                    <div class="input-group input-group-sm" style="width: 15rem">
                        <span class="input-group-text">Indice</span>
                        <input type="number" class="form-control" min="0" max="@(events.Count - 1)" @bind="targetIndex" data-testid="target-index" />
                        <button class="btn btn-primary" @onclick="ScrollToTarget" data-testid="goto">Vai</button>
                    </div>
                    <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-success" @onclick="AddAtTop">+ In cima</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-success" @onclick="AddAtBottom">+ In fondo</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-sm @(liveFeed ? "btn-success" : "btn-outline-success")" @onclick="ToggleLiveFeed">
                        @(liveFeed ? "■ Ferma flusso" : "▶ Flusso in cima")
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" @onclick="() => expanded.Clear()">Riduci tutti</button>
                </div>
                <div class="small text-body-secondary mb-2">@anchorDescription</div>

                <div class="virtualize-container" data-testid="timeline">
                    <Virtualize @ref="timeline" Items="events" Context="item" AnchorMode="anchorMode" ItemSize="90">
                        <div @key="item.Id" class="timeline-item severity-@item.Severity.ToString().ToLowerInvariant() @(item.Id == highlightedId ? "highlight" : "")"
                             data-event-id="@item.Id">
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2">
                                <div>
                                    <span class="badge text-bg-dark">#@item.Id</span>
                                    <strong class="ms-1">@item.Title</strong>
                                    <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light border ms-1">@item.Severity.ToDisplayName()</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                    <small class="text-body-secondary">@item.Timestamp.ToString("dd/MM HH:mm")</small>
                                    <button class="btn btn-sm btn-link p-0" @onclick="() => Toggle(item.Id)">
                                        @(expanded.Contains(item.Id) ? "Riduci" : "Espandi")
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="small mt-1">
                                @if (expanded.Contains(item.Id))
                                {
                                    @item.Description
                                }
                                else
                                {
                                    @(item.Description.Length > 110 ? item.Description[..110] + "…" : item.Description)
                                }
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </Virtualize>
                </div>
                @if (status is not null)
                {
                    <div class="small mt-2" data-testid="scroll-status">@status</div>
                }
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-xl-4">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header fw-semibold d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                Log in tempo reale
                <span class="badge text-bg-light border">AnchorMode.End</span>
                <button class="btn btn-sm ms-auto @(logRunning ? "btn-danger" : "btn-success")" @onclick="ToggleLog">
                    @(logRunning ? "■ Stop" : "▶ Avvia")
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <div class="log-container" data-testid="log">
                    <Virtualize Items="logLines" Context="line" AnchorMode="VirtualizeAnchorMode.End" ItemSize="20">
                        <div @key="line.Id" class="log-line level-@line.Level">@line.Text</div>
                    </Virtualize>
                </div>
                <div class="small text-body-secondary mt-2">
                    @logLines.Count righe. Resta in fondo come una chat; se scorri verso l'alto la posizione viene mantenuta.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<ObserveBox>
    <ul class="mb-0">
        <li>Scorri velocemente la timeline: nessun "salto" anche se ogni elemento ha un'altezza diversa.</li>
        <li>Espandi e riduci eventi mentre scorri: le altezze cambiano e la posizione resta stabile.</li>
        <li>Usa <em>Vai</em> con indice 5000 o <em>Fine</em>: <code>ScrollToItemAsync</code> porta l'elemento in cima, senza JavaScript custom.</li>
        <li>Con <code>AnchorMode = Start</code> e lista in cima, il flusso di nuovi eventi resta visibile; con <code>None</code> la vista non si sposta.</li>
        <li>Il log usa <code>AnchorMode.End</code>: le nuove righe (anche su più linee) restano in vista, come in una chat.</li>
    </ul>
</ObserveBox>
